---
<div class="notify-card">
  <div class="dot"></div>
  <div class="msg">
    <strong>Updates Available</strong>
    <p>Version 2.0 is now ready for install.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .notify-card { display: flex; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: #0f172a; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); max-width: 300px; }
  .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #6366f1; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 5px; }
  .msg p { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; }
  strong { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #fff; }
</style>
